│ ★  Owner       Name                                          ││                         LazyGithub: A Terminal UI For GitHub (0.6.6)                         │
│ ☆  parity-bot  alpha-service-with-a-deliberately-long-repos  ││                                                                                              │
│ ☆  parity-bot  amber-service-with-a-deliberately-long-repos  ││  LazyGithub is a terminal UI for interacting with GitHub. You can get started by selecting   │
│ ☆  parity-bot  basalt-service-with-a-deliberately-long-repo▁▁││  one of the repositories listed in the table on the left. Once you have selected a           │
│ ☆  parity-bot  bravo-service-with-a-deliberately-long-repos  ││  repository, any issues, pull requests, and action workflows will be retrieved and           │
│ ☆  parity-bot  charlie-service-with-a-deliberately-long-rep  ││  displayed below it.                                                                         │
│ ☆  parity-bot  cobalt-service-with-a-deliberately-long-repo  ││                                                                                              │
│ ☆  parity-bot  delta-service-with-a-deliberately-long-repos  ││  Issues, pull requests, and action lists can also be interacted with!                        │
│ ☆  parity-bot  dune-service-with-a-deliberately-long-reposi  ││                                                                                              │
│ ☆  parity-bot  echo-service-with-a-deliberately-long-reposi  ││                                                                                              │
│ ☆  parity-bot  foxtrot-service-with-a-deliberately-long-rep  ││  Pull Requests                                                                               │
